{"description":"A team trying to explore microbiological solutions for adapting farms using NASA’s data","image":"https://assets.spaceappschallenge.org/media/images/att.3t9hZilKXFL-CqEs7OIbLIIQPI-74i.2e16d0ba.fill-300x250.jpg","summary":"Our project is about making a hole system for making sure farms adapt with any change that might happen","details":"<p>Our project consists of two parts: first part is biocapsules that planted in soil and contain: nutrients and microorganisms to increase fertility of soil, and a small sensor installed in different specific parts of land to cover it(those sensors sense PH and salinity and NPK levels of soil) and it connected wirelessly with mega station.</p><p>The second part is the mega station: contains large containers of water and nutrients and microorganisms. The station connected with the farm with ducts cover the whole land, so using NASA’s data and the sensors in soil we can treat any problem before it happens</p>","dataRefs":[["SMAP","https://data.nasa.gov/dataset/soil-moisture-active-passive-smap-cpex"],["NASA GPM","https://data.nasa.gov/dataset/gpm-ground-validation-nasa-er-2-navigation-data-olympex"],["ALOS PLASAR","https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fshare.google%2Fm8ZdwkIpXVbvzaeWy%3Ffbclid%3DIwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTEAcGRvZgNzcnRjBmFwcF9pZA80Mzc2MjYzMTY5NzM3ODgAAR_thIJrKs-38BZUbecp47roxDVMs2zfx0VEkZ0P0DeDzuXJj1ilw5nDmNO44Q_aem_O8vGhH7n0558rfmiKvlfuQ&h=AUChX0gsPc-srlVZYwD3F_dKqV6V8DEQ1dSTJQi43T9Rin_Jl-jhDLtIKZq863IIQgg-XHthj7ZT-Fsu2birYPZWROUcIW7YfpO5K75U9GOvcmht2sECXeHKdKnnXFo&s=1"],["Aerial photography ","https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fdata.nasa.gov%2Fdataset%2Fnasa-aerial-photography%3Futm_source%3Dchatgpt.com%26fbclid%3DIwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTEAcGRvZgNzcnRjBmFwcF9pZA80Mzc2MjYzMTY5NzM3ODgAAR8coOkWUle1SUou32mX4qnhdKATZFzhX76weVh0H_nJ5GPne6rr8vshIIpY8g_aem_lPIJlmCTlimZt0E9PGq1KA&h=AUDQboYDa-0wLBRSx0-rUETSIRPK9kGI0_eZZnelhdfFehk08tVD82cYuIEbOWd-EhlpfStt9unNi0iRKccHjtZWCmCtY6yidTSB4dgflhsvRqErTbczSyWLn33U4hc&s=1"]